---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use — Saddleback Valley Endodontics"
  description="Terms of Use for the Saddleback Valley Endodontics website. Please read these terms before using our site."
>
  <Header variant="solid" />

  <main>

    <section class="legal-intro">
      <p class="legal-eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </section>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using the Saddleback Valley Endodontics website (sbvendo.com), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website.</p>
        <p>These terms apply to all visitors, users, and others who access or use the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Use of the Website</h2>
        <p>This website is provided for informational purposes only. You may use it to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Learn about our practice, services, and team</li>
          <li>Request appointments or contact our office</li>
          <li>Access general educational information about endodontic care</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You agree not to use this website for any unlawful purpose, to transmit harmful or offensive content, to attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the site, or to interfere with the proper functioning of the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Not a Substitute for Professional Medical Advice</h2>
        <p>The content on this website — including text, images, and other materials — is provided for general informational purposes only. It is not intended to be, and should not be interpreted as, professional medical or dental advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>
        <p>Always seek the guidance of a qualified dental professional with any questions you may have regarding a dental condition or treatment. Never disregard professional advice or delay seeking it because of something you have read on this website.</p>
        <p>Use of this website does not create a doctor-patient relationship between you and Saddleback Valley Endodontics.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All content on this website — including text, graphics, logos, photographs, and page layouts — is the property of Saddleback Valley Endodontics or its content providers and is protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws.</p>
        <p>You may view and print pages from this website for personal, non-commercial use only. Any other use, including reproduction, modification, distribution, or republication, requires our prior written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, including patient portal systems, referral platforms, and mapping services. These links are provided for your convenience only. We have no control over the content or practices of those sites and accept no responsibility for them.</p>
        <p>Visiting a third-party site from our website is at your own risk and subject to the terms and privacy policies of that site.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>This website is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not warrant that the site will be uninterrupted, error-free, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</p>
        <p>We make no representations about the accuracy, completeness, or suitability of the information on this site for any purpose.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Saddleback Valley Endodontics shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of — or inability to use — this website or its content.</p>
        <p>Our total liability for any claim arising from your use of this website shall not exceed the greater of $100 or the amount you paid to use the site (if any).</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Privacy</h2>
        <p>Your use of this website is also governed by our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>, which is incorporated into these Terms of Use by reference. Please review it to understand our data practices.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Use at any time. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Your continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>These Terms of Use are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes arising under these terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts located in Orange County, California.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us:</p>
        <address>
          <strong>Saddleback Valley Endodontics</strong><br/>
          25261 Paseo De Valencia, Suite 3<br/>
          Laguna Hills, CA 92637<br/>
          <a href="tel:+19495818890">(949) 581-8890</a><br/>
          <a href="mailto:office@sbvendo.com">office@sbvendo.com</a>
        </address>
      </section>

    </div>

  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  main { padding-top: var(--header-h); }

  .legal-intro {
    padding: clamp(72px, 12vh, 120px) clamp(28px, 6vw, 88px) clamp(48px, 7vh, 72px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    max-width: 800px;
  }
  .legal-eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.36em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-ink-soft); margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px); line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-ink-soft); margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-body {
    padding: clamp(56px, 9vh, 96px) clamp(28px, 6vw, 88px) clamp(80px, 12vh, 140px);
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vh, 60px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vh, 60px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .legal-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 26px); letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }
  .legal-section h3 {
    font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    margin: 28px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal-section p {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 16px); line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft); margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .legal-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-left: 0; list-style: none;
  }
  .legal-section ul li {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.3vw, 16px); line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft); padding: 6px 0 6px 20px;
    position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .legal-section ul li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line); }
  .legal-section ul li::before {
    content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft); font-size: 12px;
  }
  .legal-section strong { color: var(--color-ink); font-weight: 500; }
  .legal-section a { border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .legal-section a:hover { opacity: 0.6; }
  .legal-section address {
    font-style: normal; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .legal-section address a { display: inline; }
</style>
